fidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 0.0, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 40.0, "headline_body_divergence": 0.0, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "9bd670d0-1200-4f48-8ccb-f3dd7675a445", "title": "For feminists, the deaths of Parton and Steinem days apart deliver a double dose of grief", "url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/nation/for-feminists-the-deaths-of-parton-and-steinem-days-apart-deliver-a-double-dose-of-grief", "summary": "Gloria Steinem and Dolly Parton's deaths eight days apart sent a double dose of grief around the world and across generations as many women (and some men!) asked who would take their places at the forefront of women's rights.", "published_at": "2026-09-05T16:56:30+00:00", "image_url": null, "source": {"name": "PBS NewsHour", "tier": "us_major", "url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 17, "confidence": 0.15, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 14.6, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 40.0, "headline_body_divergence": 30.9, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "9eb427de-ad86-483b-98f7-db01772baa1b", "title": "Gloria Steinem was a feminist icon – and \"wherever there's antisemitism, a Jew\"", "url": "https://www.haaretz.com/opinion/2026-09-05/ty-article-opinion/.premium/gloria-steinem-was-a-feminist-icon-and-wherever-theres-antisemitism-a-jew/000001a0-71a6-dec9-a7ff-f1a738bb0000", "summary": "The influential writer and activist who died this week was a trailblazer for women in journalism and politics. Throughout her life, she showed a willingness to learn from her critics and adapt to new political realities", "published_at": "2026-09-05T13:24:41+00:00", "image_url": "https://img.haarets.co.il/bs/000001a0-71a6-dec9-a7ff-f1a738bb0000/3a/97/e30382954660a09523c712bc3e54/775622.jpg?precrop=2400,1395,x0,y122&width=1200&height=630&cmsprod", "source": {"name": "Haaretz", "tier": "international", "url": "https://www.haaretz.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 8, "confidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 2.0, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 10.0, "headline_body_divergence": 22.5, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "d729dcc5-ea23-40e7-bf2b-732088eef802", "title": "Look back: Gloria Steinem on the founding of Ms. Magazine", "url": "https://www.cbsnews.com/video/look-back-gloria-steinem-on-the-founding-of-ms-magazine/", "summary": "Gloria Steinem, a trailblazing figure in the women's liberation movement who died on Sept. 2, 2026 at age 92, was a 30-something columnist for New York magazine when she helped found a publication aimed at pushing feminism into the mainstream. In this \"Sunday Morning\" report that originally aired Sept. 17, 2023, Steinem talked with Rita Braver about the origin of Ms. Magazine. Braver also talked with Ms. executive editor Katherine Spillar, who compiled the anthology, \"50 Years of Ms.: The Best of the Pathfinding Magazine That Ignited a Revolution.\"", "published_at": "2026-09-06T13:44:18+00:00", "image_url": "https://assets3.cbsnewsstatic.com/hub/i/r/2026/09/06/ab037ecc-da92-485f-9dd8-dffe1ff78da1/thumbnail/1200x630/903fa77d8ab63137c55513127b5488c7/gloria-steinem-1920.jpg", "source": {"name": "CBS News", "tier": "us_major", "url": "https://www.cbsnews.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 35, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 48, "confidence": 0.178, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 100.0, "keyword_emphasis_score": 7.5, "omission_score": 40.0, "headline_body_divergence": 58.3, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}]